WEBVTT

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.860
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.540
<i>I'm finally here!</i>

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>The elf settlement of Lalatoya!</i>

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.520
Open the gate!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.290
I am Ariane Glenys Maple,

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:23.150
and I have returned from my mission 
of saving our kind from human captivity.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.740
I seek an audience with the elder!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.240
<i>This is a heaping helping of fantasy! 
A fantasy buffet!</i>

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>A sacred temple erected 
in the name of the fantasy genre!</i>

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:44.200
<i>An elf village! And now... now...!</i>

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.910
<i>The elves live over there!</i>

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.920
I'm going to get permission from the elder.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.410
Wait here, Arc.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:29.710
I gotta say, this place 
is as huge as it is old.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:33.410
Well, elves are supposed to 
have centuries-long lifespans...

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:38.420
This settlement has probably 
been here since ages long past.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.580
I'm gonna get ya!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:55.410
One, two, three, four...

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:11.270
Sorry about the delay. I got permission.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.000
Come on.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.760
All right, let's get going.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.630
What's that massive tree?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.460
The elder lives there.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.800
We bid you welcome.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:01.820
I am Dillan Tahg Lalatoya, 
the elder of this village.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.880
I hear you've been 
a great help to my daughter.

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:08.090
I am Glenys, his wife, and Aria's mother.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.340
It's a pleasure to make your 
acquaintance, Sir Elder, milady.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.460
My name is Arc and I am 
a traveling mercenary who...

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.880
You two are Lady Ariane's 
mother and father?!

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.360
I turned 170 this year.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.820
And that number isn't changing.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.640
It isn't?!

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.780
She's actually 245.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.030
Mother, I swear, you're always like this...

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.990
<i>Then elves really are long-lived!</i>

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:39.690
Wait, you were the elder's 
daughter all along, Lady Ariane?!

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.130
Did I not mention that?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:44.410
My daughter has informed me 
of the general picture.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.980
It seems you've helped some of our kin.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:50.840
I would like to thank you 
on behalf of all elves.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.040
You have our gratitude.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.040
That being said,

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:58.680
it was unexpected to hear that she 
would attack a feudal lord's palace...

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.940
They were the ones who broke the treaty!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.210
This was meant to be a message to strike 
at the kidnapper's operations.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.980
Why attack a lord's home?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:06.920
Well...

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.870
Sir Elder...

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.530
Allow me to elaborate.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.660
I see.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:20.240
You were rescuing girls who had been 
captured by Diento's lord...

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.480
I understand how it came to pass.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:30.400
But I'll need to explain what has happened 
at the general meeting of the elders.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.970
I'll accompany you.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.080
Good.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.700
I plan on traveling to Maple in the morning.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:40.640
This trafficking contract needs 
to be brought to their attention, as well.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.520
Right.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.280
Is that all for the political talk?

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.820
Then why don't we have dinner?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.530
We give thanks for this meal.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.000
Arc, you can relax.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.920
I've heard about your condition.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.260
You needn't worry about Glenys and me.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.870
Thank you for the food.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.490
There's lots more, so don't hesitate to ask.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.470
That would be wonderful!

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.700
Oh, good morning, Arcky.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.500
Arc...ky?

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.760
Did you get a good night's rest?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.640
You're certainly up early, Lady Glenys.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.770
Are Sir Dillan and Lady Ariane already gone?

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.600
Yes, they just left.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.290
Wait one moment. 
Breakfast is ready to be served.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.880
I'm most grateful.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.550
We've just been waiting 
for you, Lord Dillan.

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:18.490
The transport circle to Maple is ready.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.360
Off we go, Ariane.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.160
Right.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.250
Step right up.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.900
m 0 0 l 134 0 l 134 55 l 0 55

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.900
Forest Capital of Maple

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.640
Looking for medicinal herbs?

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:51.450
We've got medicinal herbs, 
the best you could ask for!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.150
You want to see which tastes better?

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.050
Elder Dillan of Lalatoya...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:22.970
I believe you are here to report on the 
investigation into the kidnappings, yes?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.980
Chief Elder
Briahn Boyd Evangelin Maple

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.290
Yes, sir.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:29.110
I'm honored that you would show me around.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:33.120
Well, after how you helped look 
after Ariane, it's the least I can do.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.320
Is this settlement 
a comparatively larger one?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.310
There seems to be many elves, as well...

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:40.650
Well, for security,

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.040
we absorbed a few of the smaller settlements 
that used to be in this area,

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.330
and now we number around 4,000.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:52.280
<i>I guess these kidnappings 
are a common thing...</i>

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.080
What's a human doing here?

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.260
Are we going to be safe?

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.380
I've never seen armor like that before...

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.450
What's a human doing here?

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.480
Oh! Mr. Armor!

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.510
Oh, it's you girls!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.100
You came to visit, Mister!

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.220
Indeed.

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.650
Lady Ariane was nice enough to host me.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.870
Look at this!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.400
Since you healed me, 
I'm perfectly fine again!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.600
See?!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.200
Oh, I see! That's good to know.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.240
You two take care, all right?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.800
Thanks!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.270
Bye-bye, Mister!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.250
See you around!

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:40.680
My apologies for the delay, Lady Glenys.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.580
It's quite all right, Arcky.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.470
They were happy to see you.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:49.060
Changing the subject, how would you like 
to spar for a bit with me?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.590
Spar...?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:57.070
Episode 6

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:57.070
Learning About the Darkness of This World at the Elf Village

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.320
The matter of the lord's palace...

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.710
it can only be described as careless.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:08.800
Going out of their way 
to break a 400 year old treaty...

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.960
That's as much justification 
for war as there has ever been.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:17.250
Have the humans already forgotten how

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:21.290
our lands were split in two 
during the war, 600 years ago?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:27.170
What happened only a generation ago 
for us is a matter of history for humans.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.270
There are none alive who still remember.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:38.400
Perhaps we could send a notice 
explaining the situation to the Rhoden Kingdom?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.160
Great Elder
Fangas Flan Maple

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:43.160
We're under no obligation to 
justify ourselves to them!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.250
And if we reveal 
the details of this operation,

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.800
those who are executing it would be

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.610
at risk of being summoned 
by the nation in question.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:54.080
We should not show weakness here.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:58.600
True enough, it was the humans 
who broke the treaty first.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:03.300
But still, attacking a lord's home 
was excessive.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:07.970
If it becomes public knowledge, 
it could spark another war.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:14.390
The operation to liberate 
our kindred will continue,

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.520
while carefully watching 
for the kingdom of Rhoden's reaction.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:19.780
I see no other way.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.120
Just to make sure,

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.440
this will be a match between you 
and me, Lady Glenys?

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.200
Yes. It's all right.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.460
You saw Ariane fight, haven't you?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:38.400
I was the one who taught 
her how to use a sword.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.880
I should be up to the task.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:45.970
Besides, dark elves are blessed 
with physical gifts.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:49.630
So when we get the measure of someone,

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.940
we have a tendency 
to test their strength, too.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:56.960
Not to mention, if you're going to be 
traveling with my precious little girl...

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.330
As her mother, I want to 
know she can rely on you.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.990
I see. Understood.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.280
Okay, then!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:08.040
Here I... come!

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:12.700
<i>Fast—</i>

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:25.640
You saw me coming, but you reacted 
to the surprise like an amateur.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:28.550
If you notice an attack, you need to dodge it 
with the bare minimum of movement.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.820
Come on, take your stance!

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.020
We're nowhere near done!

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.740
<i>This is better than I hoped!</i>

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:40.990
<i>If I want to live in this world, 
I'm going to need to know how to use a sword!</i>

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:45.950
<i>And now I'm getting a lesson from an expert!</i>

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.020
Come on, get ready!

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:50.660
I am ready!

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:51.950
Okay!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.160
Father...

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.560
I'm so sorry.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:22.520
You did it to save our kin. 
There was no other way.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.670
You'll be continuing your search.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:29.140
And we'll hire Arc to help you, 
in an official capacity.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.570
That took longer than I expected.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:36.730
It would've been nice to see Eevin, 
since we're in Maple...

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.920
Did you have business with Sister?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.420
That's right, you hadn't been told yet.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:46.920
Eevin's going to 
be married, next year.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.960
My sister?

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.240
The combat addict who said 
she would never get married...

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.640
is getting married?!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.490
Oh, Arin!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:06.670
I can't believe you were going to 
go home without saying hello!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.890
Sister Eevin!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.140
I'm so glad I managed to catch you!

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.830
I-I'm sorry.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.630
It's good to see you again, Sister Eevin...

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:20.280
I skipped out on my duty because 
I heard you were coming, you know!

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:22.270
You never change, Eevin.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.470
Oh, you're here too, Father?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:27.220
But more importantly, it's not "sister"!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.960
It's "big sis"!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:32.050
Oh, you've gotten so big 
since I last saw you!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.440
Come on...

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.600
I'm going on ahead.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.390
Father, wait!

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.720
Honestly, Big Sis...

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:45.140
I mean it, though. I am proud of you.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:50.040
I heard about how many 
of our kind you've saved.

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.850
You've become strong!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:54.420
Hardly.

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:58.870
I still have a long way to go, 
compared to you.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.680
B-By the way, I heard you 
were getting married.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.070
Is that true?

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:04.360
It is!

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:10.160
Are you jealous at the idea of someone 
stealing your loving big sis away, Arin?

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.600
What's he like?

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:18.250
Well, he's serious, and sincere, 
and honestly quite an oddball.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.850
You're curious, right?

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.240
Not really...

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:27.870
And is there no one you're 
interested in yourself, Arin?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.600
Th-There isn't...

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.790
Oh, that reaction!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.060
Well, that's no good!

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:38.800
If someone wants to marry you, 
they need to be stronger than me!

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:42.370
You don't ever plan 
on letting me get married, then?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.800
Exactly!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:47.870
Big Sis, cut it out!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:02.890
Dimension Move!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.100
<b>Dimension Move</b>

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.320
I have you now!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.300
I'm vanquished...

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:15.000
Oh, the sun is already setting.

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:19.120
I should get dinner ready 
before the others are back.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.910
Why don't we run on home, Arcky?

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:25.450
R-Right you are, Lady Glenys.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:32.170
<i>I guess there's a kind of strength where 
high stats will only get you so far...</i>

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.840
<i>This is a wide world, Ponta.</i>

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.720
That was quite a sweat!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.040
I can't wait to jump in the bath.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.600
Bath?!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:48.080
You really want to get in the bath? You?

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.670
I am fully prepared to pay, as well.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.190
There's no need for that.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:57.570
But why don't you wash Ponta 
while you're in there?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.730
I think I'll do just that!

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:08.720
Come on, Ponta, quit squirming.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.910
We've gotta get you nice and clean.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.170
Hey, bubble hurricane!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:23.310
This is my first time in the bath 
since coming to the world...

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:27.980
There's nothing like soaking through to the 
bones after working up a good sweat, Ponta.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:32.440
Although I guess I didn't 
actually sweat. Oh, well!

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:48.620
I bet I look like a washed 
up corpse, don't I, Ponta?

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.770
Skeleton!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.570
Lady Ariane, hold! It's me! It is I, Arc!

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:22.720
You could have told me
you were in the bath.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.160
F-Forgive me.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.890
Oh, what's wrong, Ariane? 
You're bright red.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:29.970
It's nothing! Don't worry about it!

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.030
I see you're both here.

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:37.130
Now, before dinner, let's 
discuss your agenda going forward.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:43.940
At the general meeting of the elders,

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.820
it was decided you would 
investigate the names involved

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.110
in the contract and continue freeing our kin.

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:54.270
To that end, I would like to hire you 
to continue to assist Ariane, Arc.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:59.740
However, to be frank, we can't 
offer much in the way of payment...

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:04.240
You seem to have more money 
than we do, after all.

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:10.560
Which is why I can offer
a bit of information instead.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.920
Information?

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:16.630
It could lead to breaking 
the curse upon your body.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:24.640
There is said to be a spring near 
the Lord Crown that can break any curse.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.960
This could be just what I have searched for!

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.640
Tell me, what is this Lord Crown?

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.940
Out of the several kinds 
of dragonkin in the world,

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.810
the greatest of them all 
are the Dragon Lords.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:42.860
And the Lord Crown is a rare type of great tree 
that grows where a Dragon Lord makes its home.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.520
There are spirits 
who dwell in the Lord Crown,

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:49.580
which has a variety of effects 
on its wood and leaves.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:54.690
But because a Dragon Lord 
lives in its vicinity,

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:57.810
any who disturb the spirits 
will suffer for it dearly.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.520
I see.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:05.150
Is it possible to enter the domain 
of this Dragon Lord and survive?

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:08.280
It'd be dangerous for a human,

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:13.160
but if an elf were to arrange for it, 
we should get permission to enter.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.880
So, what do you say?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:20.010
Is knowledge of this 
spring a suitable reward?

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.200
Of course!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.840
<i>This curse-breaking stuff 
was something I made up</i>

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:26.680
<i>as part of my character's 
background, for RP purposes...</i>

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.990
<i>but I guess it's a whole thing now.</i>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.100
You don't need to worry.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:35.120
When you head to the spring, 
I'll be joining you, Arc.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.210
Really?

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.560
What do you say, Arc?

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:43.170
Would you be willing to lend 
the elves your strength once again?

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.880
Of course!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.240
And you have my thanks for the information.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:49.430
I would be glad to lend you my sword!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:55.230
I truly appreciate it. 
You'll be a great help.

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.480
Does that settle all the business talk?

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.940
Why don't we have dinner, then?

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:10.160
<i>Looks like I'm going to be looking for elves 
with Lady Ariane again tomorrow.</i>

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:21.040
<i>I have to wonder, do I really
look like this because of a curse?</i>

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:24.080
<i>It was just an avatar before,</i>

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.760
<i>but if it really is 
because of a curse now...</i>

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:31.340
<i>The mid-tier Bishop class has Uncurse...</i>

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:32.760
<b>U
n
c
u
r
s
e</b>

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:35.040
<i>I may be able to use it 
on myself to lift it.</i>

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:41.800
<i>There's also the high-tier 
Priest class's Holy Purify, but...</i>

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:46.000
<i>That one causes major damage to undead, 
on top of breaking curses.</i>

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:51.710
<i>Let's try just the tip.</i>

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.910
<b>U
n
c
u
r
s
e</b>

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.910
Uncurse

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:55.700
Uncurse!

